WEBVTT

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:15.990
Oh, Ushio-chan?

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:20.090
Was it your turn to work in the library today?

00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:22.790
Yeah, they changed my days.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:29.920
Do you want one?

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:33.010
Excuse me.

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:41.970
I forgot something.

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:46.290
I'm sorry. Please go on ahead.

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:48.710
Ushio-chan!

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:37.630
She wants to reconcile?

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:40.460
That upperclassman you were talking about?

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:46.140
She wants to apologize to Ushio-chan for all the mean things she said.

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:49.610
That woman!

00:02:49.610 --> 00:02:53.830
First she thrusts Kazama into a pit of despair, and now she wants to reconcile?

00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:55.650
How selfish.

00:02:57.950 --> 00:03:00.900
She wants you to wait for her
in the library after school today.

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:02.840
You had a crush on her, didn't you?

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:04.290
This is your big chance!

00:03:06.730 --> 00:03:07.990
Ushio-chan?

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:11.970
I suppose.

00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:27.060
Murasame-kun, who is this upperclassman you were talking about earlier?

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:29.310
This doesn't concern you two.

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:30.990
We're friends, aren't we?

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:33.310
Yeah, yeah.

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:38.600
Nishikigi Chizuka.

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:40.860
She's a sophomore librarian.

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:45.530
Kazama was really into her
until just a short while ago.

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:47.780
So that's her type?

00:03:47.780 --> 00:03:48.830
That stupid—

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:52.790
The boy she liked fell for Kazama.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:57.930
Then, out of vengeful spite,
she made Kazama cry.

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:00.840
I see. So that's how it is.

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:05.790
I thought Kazama had already gotten over it...

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:10.600
...but it looks like she hasn't.

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:13.890
That's the toughest part
of having an unrequited crush.

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:16.910
You should just tell her how you feel already.

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:19.640
If only it were that easy.

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:25.130
Kazama likes cute girls like her.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:34.380
Rather than cute...

00:04:35.570 --> 00:04:36.640
Ditzy?

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:41.380
Kazama likes ditzy girls?

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:43.920
In that case...

00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:45.870
It's time for special training!

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:47.140
Wait, what?

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:57.620
It's probably easier to turn a non-ditzy girl into a ditzy one than to turn one who's not cute into one who is!

00:04:57.620 --> 00:04:59.280
I-I see.

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:02.700
You must break out of your self-imposed shell...

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:07.140
...and be reborn as a ditz who is loved by all!

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:08.160
Right now!

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:12.660
A banana peel?!

00:05:13.970 --> 00:05:15.160
It's delicious.

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:17.690
No one pulls this these days.

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:19.230
It's all about the basics!

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:20.990
A journey of a thousand miles
begins with a single step!

00:05:20.990 --> 00:05:22.940
"I" for iroha! "A" for asahi!

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:24.910
Girls, be ambitious!

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:30.000
You know, talking back isn't really cute.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.560
You do it first, then!

00:05:31.900 --> 00:05:34.520
This has nothing to do with being cute!

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:38.440
Very well. Observe carefully!

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:40.940
Taema Miyako will—

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:45.910
It hurts!

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:48.950
I honestly can't tell whether you did that on purpose or not, Miyako.

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:56.660
Can lunch please be over soon?

00:05:58.650 --> 00:06:02.430
I wonder what Kazama is doing right now.

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:04.680
Now then, does it hurt here?

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:12.110
Hey, Kiyori-chan.
Do you know where Sumi-chan is?

00:06:12.110 --> 00:06:14.220
I saw her on the roof.

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:19.070
She was standing around a banana peel with Hachisuka-san and some others.

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:36.000
Murasame!

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:37.990
Now, step on it!

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:41.630
With this one step, you will capture the hearts of ditz lovers across the nation!

00:06:58.240 --> 00:06:59.080
Murasame-san.

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:00.520
I can't do this!

00:07:08.510 --> 00:07:09.560
Akemiya-kun!

00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:10.200
Nice one!

00:07:12.940 --> 00:07:15.580
I'm sorry! Are you all right?

00:07:15.840 --> 00:07:17.710
I'm fine.

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:20.340
Um, about the student council meeting yesterday—

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:21.580
An impressive display!

00:07:22.140 --> 00:07:25.150
To think that there'd be such hidden talent here!

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:31.220
You, on other hand, Murasame-kun — if you let something like this deter you, you'll never be a first-class entertainer.

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:32.330
I don't want to!

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:34.850
Just what are you trying to make me do?

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:37.820
Please calm down, Murasame-san.

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:40.000
She's not playing along at all.

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:41.230
It's no big deal.

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:46.250
I'll be looking forward to the amusing antics you'll provide us with as a ditz, Murasame-kun.

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:50.380
You really have lost the thread.

00:07:56.480 --> 00:08:00.040
Starting tomorrow, they'll be changing the roof of the bicycle shed,

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:05.040
so you'll need to park your bikes behind the gym for the next three weeks.

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:14.720
Is she still thinking about her?

00:08:30.930 --> 00:08:32.220
Sumi-chan.

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:37.320
Can I come over to your house today?

00:08:50.610 --> 00:08:52.480
What's this about?

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:03.700
Does this mean that she chose me over her?

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:05.390
A ditz!

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:09.880
Murasame-kun, now is the time to show the results of your training!

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:12.800
A ditz! You must become a ditz!

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:15.030
I understand!

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:19.350
Glasses... Where are my glasses?

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:21.610
I might have done something I shouldn't have.

00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:30.210
Senpai was actually reaching out
to me through Kiyori-chan.

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:34.820
Are you sure it's all right to just leave her alone?

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:40.130
I don't have any feelings for her anymore.

00:09:54.460 --> 00:09:59.150
Kazama lied.

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:27.850
Could I spend the night at your place, Sumi-chan?

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:34.800
My brother is away on business,
so it might be dangerous.

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:38.360
Sure. If you want to.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:44.510
I'll just grab some clothes.

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:45.950
You can go on ahead.

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:48.620
It's fine; I'll wait for you.

00:10:51.740 --> 00:10:55.520
I've always been watching Kazama.

00:10:56.500 --> 00:10:58.820
I could tell immediately that she was lying.

00:11:02.960 --> 00:11:06.050
That's why it cuts that much deeper.

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:16.870
Because at this very moment...

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:23.820
...Kazama isn't by my side because she wants to be.

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:34.670
What's this?

00:11:35.050 --> 00:11:38.420
Well, I ruined it last time...

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:39.720
I'm sorry.

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:41.950
You don't have to worry about it.

00:11:42.560 --> 00:11:46.040
Oh, you even have it framed!

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:49.430
Well, it's a memento after all.

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:52.220
I'll put it up too, then!

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:53.690
Thank you.

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:58.730
Time sure flies.

00:11:58.730 --> 00:12:01.200
It's already been three months.

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:01.210
Yeah. A lot has happened.
It's already been three months.

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:05.320
Yeah. A lot has happened.

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:10.450
Sumi-chan?

00:12:11.740 --> 00:12:12.810
Did you put on weight?

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:15.270
You...

00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:16.770
I'm just kidding!

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:17.770
Excuse me.

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:18.700
Well, I've been...

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:20.920
Ushio-san, what would you like for dinner?

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:21.920
Right here?

00:12:25.170 --> 00:12:27.600
How about Osekihan?

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:29.570
Why?

00:12:42.590 --> 00:12:46.570
You're as cute as ever, Ushio-chan.

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:49.890
How about sharing some of that with Sumika?

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:52.110
Father, you say that every
single time Kazama comes to visit.

00:12:52.110 --> 00:12:53.190
Would you like some more?

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:54.110
Really?
Would you like some more?

00:12:54.110 --> 00:12:54.740
Yes.
Would you like some more?

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:55.220
Oh, I'm full.
Yes.

00:12:55.220 --> 00:12:57.000
Oh, I'm full.

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:58.910
Oh my.

00:12:58.910 --> 00:13:01.090
You don't need to be so reserved.

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:02.010
That's right!

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:05.410
Sumika normally eats twice that amount.

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:07.140
That's why she only grows vertically.

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:08.930
If you don't mind, let her have half!

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:12.140
Half of what? Just shut up!

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:14.000
Yo! Excuse me!

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:15.390
What is it? We're eating.

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:20.150
There's someone here to challenge us.

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:23.730
What? He needs to learn his place!

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:31.120
I, Murasame Tenkai of the Kyoku-Hoku style Karate, shall devour this challenger for dessert!

00:13:31.730 --> 00:13:36.890
Ouch! I shouldn't move around right after I eat — my stomach hurts!

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:39.340
What a ditz.

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:42.280
You find them in the most unexpected places.

00:13:43.360 --> 00:13:45.700
And my brothers have suddenly disappeared.

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:48.180
Sumika-san.

00:13:51.710 --> 00:13:54.560
Fine, I get it!

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:57.560
Why do I have to do this with Kazama here?!

00:13:58.660 --> 00:14:03.070
This household is so rowdy!

00:14:08.850 --> 00:14:11.320
Sumi-chan, you're so cool!

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:15.580
Have you learned your lesson? It's your loss!

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:17.150
Come back another day.

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:22.840
I guess I'm not cut out to be a ditz.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:26.680
Wouldn't you agree, God?

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:36.670
Man, I just don't care anymore.

00:14:38.400 --> 00:14:41.180
I have no time to ponder things in this house.

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:47.880
School is full of fools too.

00:14:49.690 --> 00:14:51.850
And Kazama is Kazama.

00:14:51.850 --> 00:14:53.740
Sumi-chan!

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:58.140
Let's wash each other!

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:02.640
I've always wanted to try it once.

00:15:03.330 --> 00:15:03.500
Geez, this girl...

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:07.890
Your house is so big! So much bigger than ours!
Geez, this girl...

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:14.360
Sumi-chan!

00:15:14.360 --> 00:15:15.140
She only thinks of me as a friend.

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:16.570
Sumi-chan!

00:15:16.570 --> 00:15:20.560
She only thinks of me as a friend.

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:29.610
I'll leave the rest to you.

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:30.490
Certainly.

00:15:30.810 --> 00:15:32.140
Noe-san.

00:15:33.330 --> 00:15:37.190
I don't like jokes like this.

00:15:44.090 --> 00:15:47.100
I'm sorry for making you worry.

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:52.760
I like it here, Sumi-chan.

00:15:53.620 --> 00:15:56.910
It's so lively and fun, with lots of people around to keep you company.

00:15:57.180 --> 00:16:00.750
It's just me and my brother at home.

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:02.930
I see.

00:16:04.600 --> 00:16:07.370
Especially today...

00:16:19.980 --> 00:16:23.680
In the end, she still can't let her go.

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:34.340
Kazama!

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:46.400
I tripped! I actually tripped!

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:49.830
What is this euphoric feeling?

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:53.890
Sumi-chan, are you all right?

00:16:53.890 --> 00:16:54.660
Wait a second.

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:57.680
Sorry, Kazama!

00:16:59.390 --> 00:17:01.290
You must be a little light-headed still.

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:12.400
I'm sorry for making you worry.

00:17:14.490 --> 00:17:16.910
I'm such a fool.

00:17:17.650 --> 00:17:24.110
Even if I avoid her like this,
Senpai isn't simply going to disappear.

00:17:25.420 --> 00:17:30.700
I liked her so much,
so why can't I bear to see her face now?

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:32.910
It's cruel...

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:37.410
...isn't it?

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:40.760
Senpai didn't do anything wrong.

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:47.030
I just willfully fell in love with her
and just as willfully came to dislike her.

00:17:49.280 --> 00:17:50.480
Willfully...

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:07.100
It's not your fault, Kazama.

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:18.130
Falling in love, even with another girl —
it's not something you can control.

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:26.020
If someone speaks poorly of you because of it,

00:18:26.320 --> 00:18:29.860
I'll beat them up!

00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:35.630
Thank you.

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:41.300
I thought you'd say that.

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:49.960
Hey, Sumi-chan?

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:05.290
I love you!

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:12.040
It's so nice to have a best friend you can rely on!

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:14.070
Well then, good night.

00:19:41.460 --> 00:20:12.800
Good morning, Sumi-chan.

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:17.990
Good morning.

00:20:22.920 --> 00:20:23.530
Senpai!

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:28.510
Kazama-san.

00:20:28.510 --> 00:20:31.860
I'm so sorry for standing you up yesterday.

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:33.350
You don't have to...

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:39.800
But please try to understand;
it's because I really liked you.

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:43.920
It was so hard for me to think that you hated me.

00:20:43.920 --> 00:20:47.000
I'm sorry as well.

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:50.810
How do you feel about me, Senpai?

00:20:51.650 --> 00:20:52.630
Do you like me?

00:20:52.630 --> 00:20:53.810
Do you dislike me?

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:56.380
Kazama-san?

00:20:56.380 --> 00:20:57.890
Morning.

00:20:57.890 --> 00:21:01.570
Oh, so those two reconciled.

00:21:03.090 --> 00:21:07.880
It seems like Sumi-chan, the ever-dependable solid anchor of a best friend...

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:12.080
...gave "Bimbo Boobs" an unnecessary boost in courage.

00:21:17.220 --> 00:21:19.350
Good morning.

00:21:21.770 --> 00:21:24.350
Hey, Kazama.

00:21:24.350 --> 00:21:26.920
Yamasaki Akemi-chan is here.

00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:27.760
Murasame-san?

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:29.630
Are you sure?

00:21:29.630 --> 00:21:30.630
It's Akemi-chan.

00:21:30.630 --> 00:21:32.740
Who are you talking about?
It's Akemi-chan.

00:21:32.740 --> 00:21:35.110
Let me go!

00:23:08.850 --> 00:23:10.850
See you, Sumi-chan.

00:23:11.230 --> 00:23:14.490
There's a library staff meeting today.

00:23:17.380 --> 00:23:20.000
Perhaps I should stay behind too.

00:23:20.570 --> 00:23:24.010
Finals are getting closer,
and my house is so rowdy.

00:23:24.250 --> 00:23:27.420
Oh, you don't have to.

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:30.760
It's fine.

00:23:33.410 --> 00:23:34.460
I'll wait.

00:23:46.800 --> 00:23:48.890
See you next week!
